{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/366976-does-the-pact-maker-remember","id":366976,"title":"Does the pact maker remember?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-11T22:01:37-08:00","id":366976,"title":"Does the pact maker remember?","content":"Let's say, for example, I made a deal with a Demon, in exchange for a relationship with my ex, for something... after the deal is done, do I remember my relationship with my ex? I know I made the deal... but do I actually remember the relationship?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-11T22:22:30-08:00","id":367023,"title":"","content":"No. The people <i>directly</i> involved don't remember. Their memories are altered. People <i>indirectly</i> involved still do, but unless it's odd might just brush it off.<br /> For example, Andrew, your best friend, might think it weird that you suddenly stopped dating Melody. But you'd only been going out for a few weeks, so maybe things ended badly. And every time he asks you about it you respond with &quot;who?&quot; or &quot;what are you talking about?&quot; so he might (depending on your relationship with him) just think you don't want to discuss Melody, it was <i>that</i> bad.<br /> <br /> But if you'd been dating Melody for 4 years and about to propose to her, Andrew's definitely going to think something weird is going on. Especially when he pries and you really <i>don't</i> remember her, not just don't want to discuss her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2523-tiarn","name":"Tiarn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-11T22:42:54-08:00","id":367056,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiarn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/366976-does-the-pact-maker-remember?p=367023#post367023\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am sorry to say you are factually and objectively wrong:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DtD Core p116, &quot;Pacts&quot;</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">When a demon makes a pact, she may stipulate some aspect of the other party\u2019s life as the consideration. When this pact is called in, her Cover absorbs that piece of reality, effectively \u201cediting out\u201d the human and \u201cediting in\u201d the demon. <b>The demon and the human both remember reality as it \u201creally\u201d is,</b> but other directly-affected parties simply remember the demon as having always been involved in their lives with no recollection of the person she replaced.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-11T23:11:49-08:00","id":367076,"title":"","content":"To expand on Satchel, it the opposite of what Tiarn said. You and the demon know exactly what the truth of the matter is but everyone else involved are convinced that your ex is the demon's ex. Including your ex.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3323-cmwatford","name":"cmwatford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3323_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-11T23:43:48-08:00","id":367092,"title":"","content":"Oops, yeah, sorry got that backwards.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2523-tiarn","name":"Tiarn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T01:24:41-08:00","id":368417,"title":"","content":"The rest of Tiarn's example is pretty solid though. You remember you gave Melody to the demon, but Andrew is unlikely to be affected and so might ask uncomfortable questions. Especially uncomfortable questions if he asks Melody and she says that she's been with the demon this whole time, and who the hell is he? This is how mortals, like Hunters, can often find a demon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}